    "created_at": "2024-11-26T19:27:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-11-26T19:27:33Z",
    "body": "Yeah it's unfortunate that there is a platform difference like this with the same html, and I'm worried that it's something we won't be able to change. It also poses challenges for making appearance:base work for listbox/multiple selects: https://issues.chromium.org/issues/357649033#comment4\r\n\r\nIn order to make the spec reflect the current reality, we could add some text saying that the UA may force popup rendering instead of listbox rendering if it chooses.\r\n\r\nIn order to actually allow developers to have an in-page listbox rendering that is respected across platforms and that we could have appearance:base multi-select for, I wonder if we could add another attribute?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
