    "created_at": "2025-05-13T16:37:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-13T16:37:27Z",
    "body": "In order to reuse the size attribute moving forward instead of creating a new attribute, address this issue, and have feature parity across mobile and desktop, here is my proposal:\n\n- Make `<select multiple>` always render an in-page listbox across platforms.\n- Make `<select multiple size=1>` always render as a button with a popup across platforms.\n\nThis may be a \"breaking\" change for mobile which requires authors to add the size=1 attribute if they want it, but I am working on collecting data to see how prevalent this is. Based on bug reports I've worked on over the years, I believe that `<select multiple>` as an in-page listbox on desktop is used significantly more than the popup on mobile.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/2877242732/reactions",
