    "created_at": "2025-05-14T13:03:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-14T13:04:22Z",
    "body": "> Make `<select multiple>` always render an in-page listbox across platforms.\n\nI'm not sure if this will be web compatible but seems acceptable if it is (though making it always a drop-down box would probably also be okay).\n\nWe should also make `<select size=\"5\">` always render as a listbox if possible too.",
