    "created_at": "2025-05-14T13:06:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-14T13:06:38Z",
    "body": "> I'm not sure if this will be web compatible but seems okay if it is.\n\nI made a UseCounter for how often that mobile picker is actually used here:\n- https://chromiumdash.appspot.com/commit/4b9389daefc020b1ba340e14358d3f4fd994feb4\n- https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/5549\n\nIt should reach stable by the end of may or so.\n\n> We should also make `<select size=\"5\">` always render as a listbox if possible too.\n\nYes, that is my plan. Explicit size attributes can always be used to opt in to listbox (size > 1) or menulist/popup (size == 1)",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
